// Improvised weapons (melee-and-ranged 4.6): anything with a shape. The attack is synthesised: blunt unless it has an edge or a point,
// contact area min(60, volume^(2/3) x 2) cm2, velocity 0.7, wind-up 0.45 + 0.1 x kg s, hit chance -10 points (unwieldy). Fragile things
// lose condition by the momentum of each blow they deliver or take (fragile_loss_per_unit_pm in combat/calibration.jsonc): a stool breaks
// after about three; a bottle after one, leaving shards.
[
  { "type": "improvised", "id": "stool",      "name": "Stool",       "volume_cm3": 3200, "material": "oak",  "fragile": true },
